      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呃……我记得皋月赏时也是因\n为其他选手斜向奔跑影响到她害她慢下来吧？\n该说她真不走运吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ec13e3cc16de45e6deb65b25fab50473bdc68a2b26911446af294ac3f64383",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
