      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从你至今以来的模样来看，\n就能知道你为了成为这场「日本德比」的霸主\n进行了严格训练来做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8d2e87e006c81b914e9f1ce98ed9712ea8393e9dad9139d2d0841deb91d0cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
