      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，我来猜猜你在想什么。\n你在想「光钻她真是惊人……」对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3508ea6ebbc13e2bf1630d180cfeb93095974c798c5e7cffe0cc775561d5c1fa",
